Subject: [PATCH 40/44] go.mod: sing-vmess v0.2.8-pdk13.2, with the upstream
 input validation fix

The fork's tag v0.2.8-pdk13.2 adds upstream sing-vmess 9b95ab8 "Fix protocol
input validation" (chunk lengths and checksums, VLESS addons, Vision padding
headers split across reads, the mux wrapper, XUDP frames) to v0.2.8-pdk13.1.
